%% MosaicKit – how cancellation reaches the work
graph LR
  A[Caller Task cancelled] -->|withTaskCancellationHandler| B[Tracked unstructured Task]
  C[coordinator.cancelGeneration / cancelAll] --> B
  C2[cancelAllGenerations] -->|batchEpoch += 1| D[Batch loop stops dequeuing → CancellationError]
  B -->|mosaic| E[Task.checkCancellation in stream / GPU loop / commit]
  E --> E2[stream onTermination → producer.cancel + AVAssetImageGenerator cancel]
  B -->|preview| F[onCancel → CancellationToken.cancel]
  F --> G[phase checks in PreviewGenerationLogic]
  F --> H[1 s watchdog → cancelExport / exportTask.cancel]
  F --> I[2 s ffmpeg watchdog → SIGTERM, +2 s SIGKILL]
  E --> J[OutputTransaction.discard – staging removed]
  H --> J
  I --> J
